Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.09,0:14:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,관장군대
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,관장군대
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.09,0:14:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,누구세요?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,뭐야 힉스야? 힉스야?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.39,0:14:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,아 이거 메타인 이어 같은데
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.33,0:14:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,야 이거 그
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,그 메기솔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,포에 나왔나 이게?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:14:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,아 그 레이랑 닮았는데
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,아 이거
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,레이랑 닮았는데 어떻게
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,이거
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,아
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,약점이 어디있다
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,약점이 어디있다
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,연결 부위가 약점인거
